msgid "STORY_M11_DEPARTURE_MARS"
msgstr "The tender is behind you. Ahead, Mars's independent habitats are under Union fire."

msgid "STORY_M12_ARRIVAL_LATE"
msgstr "The greenhouse is broken. Frost marks the paths where people tried to carry food inside. Help was delayed."

msgid "STORY_M12_ARRIVAL_AID"
msgstr "The mutual-aid crews are still outside. Secure the shelter route, then reach their depot. Their supplies and vehicles are needed here."

