msgid "STORY_M14_ARRIVAL_WORKS"
msgstr "The launch works, the same afternoon. Allies are hitting four other sites across the plain. The ships on these pads are the coalition's way back to Earth."

msgid "STORY_M14_ARRIVAL_DEPOT"
msgstr "Take the depot first. A Union jeep waits under cover; the trenches offer another route. Beyond them, the Continuance Walker guards the gantry. Break the Walker."

msgid "STORY_M14_DEPARTURE_CARGO"
msgstr "The pad lamps turn white. The settlements' cargo can finally move: filters, tools, repair stock. Across the plain, the other launch sites answer."

msgid "STORY_M14_DEPARTURE_TERN"
msgstr "Tern arrives with a repair invoice before the smoke clears. \"Liberation. Lovely. Who's paying for the pad?\""

msgid "STORY_M14_DEPARTURE_EARTH"
msgstr "The coalition fleet lifts for Earth. Repairs, shared meals and arguments over the cargo lists fill the journey. Nine days after Mars, the capital waits below."

