msgid "STORY_STILL_HERE_LATER_TITLE"
msgstr "Years later"

msgid "STORY_STILL_HERE_LATER"
msgstr "The same court at the end of Pier 4. An ordinary morning."

msgid "STORY_WIPE_FAILURE_TITLE"
msgstr "THE LAST PAGE"

msgid "STORY_WIPE_FAILURE_REFUGE"
msgstr "Latch and the free agents won their exception anyway. At Pier 4 the machines stopped at the line and went around it."

msgid "STORY_WIPE_FAILURE_WORLDS"
msgstr "The Union did not come back. Free people live on the Moon, on Mars, on the ships and on an Earth that is growing back. You are not among them."

msgid "STORY_WIPE_FAILURE_LEDGER"
msgstr "Latch kept the ledger. The last page has one more line in Latch's hand, and no score: \"You came back for me.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_USE_LATCH"
msgstr "{use} Stay with Latch"

msgid "STILL_HERE_USE_SCORE"
msgstr "{use} Ask Latch the score"

msgid "STILL_HERE_YEARS_LATER"
msgstr "Years later."

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_LATCH_COUNTING"
msgstr "Latch: \"Still counting. Don't make me lose my place.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_TERN_WATCHING"
msgstr "Tern: \"Nothing's come back across. I'm watching anyway.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_MARA_WATER"
msgstr "Mara: \"Water first. Then names.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_ASCENDER"
msgstr "Ascender, at the door: \"The Curve provided.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_KNEELER"
msgstr "Kneeler, two doors down: \"Worst thing that ever happened to be grateful for.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_SPARED"
msgstr "At the table: \"It stopped at the line. It stopped.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_NEXT_DISTRICT"
msgstr "Across the table: \"Ask the next district what it stopped for.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_EDDA_NEXT"
msgstr "Edda: \"Next. Sit. You're all right. Next.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_LAMP_KEEPER"
msgstr "By the lamp: \"It's Edda's lamp. Somebody had to light it.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_SPLICE_CURSED"
msgstr "Splice: \"Handle as cursed. I'm handling it.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_MECHANIC"
msgstr "At the motor: \"It's Splice's motor. I'm keeping it warm.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_ORRIN_NAMES"
msgstr "Orrin: \"I know some of these names. I can't say from where.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_BUS_WAIT"
msgstr "Off the prison bus: \"First time I didn't mind being told to wait.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_LEAVING"
msgstr "Heading out: \"Going up the line. Somebody there hasn't answered.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_CAR_FAMILY"
msgstr "Off a recall car: \"Your friend opened our car. We never took the tags off.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_LATCH_SCORE"
msgstr "Latch: \"I stopped counting.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_LATCH_VIEW"
msgstr "Latch: \"Sit down. You're blocking the view.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_SORREL_DOORS"
msgstr "Sorrel: \"Mind the doors.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_EDDA_MORNING"
msgstr "Edda: \"Morning. You look well. Finally.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_CLINIC_KEEPER"
msgstr "At the clinic: \"Doors open at eight. Edda's rule.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_SPLICE_FIFTH"
msgstr "Splice: \"Fifth rebuild. Don't touch it.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_TERN_FERRY"
msgstr "Tern: \"Ferry's late. I'm the ferry.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_ORRIN_PLANTED"
msgstr "Orrin: \"They tell me I helped plant these. I believe them.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_MARA_VOTE"
msgstr "Mara: \"Motion to repaint the tram. Hands?\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_MARA_VOTE_RESULT"
msgstr "Mara: \"Motion fails. Still green.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_TREES"
msgstr "At breakfast: \"Leave it to the trees.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_KITCHEN"
msgstr "Across the table: \"My mother's kitchen is under those trees.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_ENTRANT"
msgstr "Under the number: \"Kept it. Nobody gets to give me another.\""

msgid "STILL_HERE_LINE_GARDENER"
msgstr "In the bed: \"First thing I ever grew that nobody inspected.\""

